The current financial clearance process 
for registration and accommodation is 
complicated and slow.It requires students to 
physically submit documents,which leads to long
queues and delays.
The aim of this project is to develop a software
system that will make the process easier and faster.
The system will allow students to submit their documents 
online and reduce the need for physical queues. 
This will make the clearance process fully digital,
save time and improve efficiency in the University. 
